{
  "id": 384060429,
  "iid": 19868,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "ieee80211: fix dissection of MLO GTK, IGTK, and BIGTK KDEs",
  "description": "While dissecting a Wi-Fi 7 pcap, the existing code raises a \"Malformed packet\" exception. In looking at the code, the dissection of the MLO GTK, IGTK, and BIGTK KDEs has a catch-all field at the end that is supposed to display all the remaining bytes. However, when calculating the length of the bytes to display, it does not account for the very first byte at the beginning of the function (data_type).\n\nFixed by adding 1 to the length for each of these three case statements. Confirmed fixed and tested by successfully dissecting pcap which was failing before.",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2025-05-16T21:21:34.363Z",
